8295
07:33:53,380 --> 07:33:56,520
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: Chairman, Chairperson Mika Swansing.

8296
07:33:57,320 --> 07:33:59,180
Rep. JC Rahman A. Nava, M.D.: I am turning over the...

8297
07:33:59,180 --> 07:34:06,010
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, Paul.

