8308
07:34:36,170 --> 07:34:36,690
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: thank you po.

8309
07:34:36,790 --> 07:34:39,750
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And I would like to thank all the members of the House,

8310
07:34:39,870 --> 07:34:43,030
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: our colleagues for your active participation in today's hearings.

8311
07:34:43,370 --> 07:34:46,210
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Of course, I would like to say thank you to the BSWD family.

8312
07:34:46,210 --> 07:34:53,370
