07:34:56,290 --> 07:34:56,770
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you.

8315
07:34:56,810 --> 07:35:01,210
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you so much po, Sec, for all of your help in our locality.

8316
07:35:02,250 --> 07:35:04,570
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, siguro po, Sec, before we terminate,

8317
07:35:04,670 --> 07:35:05,210
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I would just like to ask...

8318
07:35:06,170 --> 07:35:07,170
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I would just like to ask a few questions.

8319
07:35:08,410 --> 07:35:12,710
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: The first one po, sorry, magsisinita po ako ng parokyal concern.

8320
07:35:12,830 --> 07:35:13,710
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Very quick lang po.

8321
07:35:13,710 --> 07:35:15,970
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Last year po, during the deliberations,

8322
07:35:16,090 --> 07:35:20,990
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I raised the concern around the creation of plantilia positions

8323
07:35:20,990 --> 07:35:26,970
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: or the regularization of the field workers for the different programs.

8324
07:35:27,350 --> 07:35:29,810
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: For peace po, hindi ganun kalaki yung problema

8325
07:35:29,810 --> 07:35:32,850
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: because it's a law, it's institutionalized.

8326
07:35:32,950 --> 07:35:36,090
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But for AICs and for the other programs po,

8327
07:35:36,170 --> 07:35:40,290
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: madami po nating mga field workers, mga social workers,

8328
07:35:40,490 --> 07:35:42,930
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: ay hindi pa social workers kasi hindi pa sila plantilia eh.

8329
07:35:42,930 --> 07:35:47,310
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: But we have a lot of field workers who have been working with BSWD

8330
07:35:47,310 --> 07:35:51,950
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for almost close to 10 years and still they are not yet regularized.

8331
07:35:52,230 --> 07:35:57,770
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I would advocate for the workers po in our province.

8332
07:35:58,670 --> 07:36:05,050
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: This one I raised po under the leadership of RD Vinos, PD Au,

8333
07:36:06,010 --> 07:36:06,050
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: and...

8334
07:36:06,170 --> 07:36:13,710
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: As of today po, the plantilia positions which I advocated for last year

8335
07:36:13,710 --> 07:36:15,190
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: are still not created po.

8336
07:36:15,330 --> 07:36:18,650
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So it's already been a year, they're still not regularized.

8337
07:36:18,650 --> 07:36:24,490
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So I advocate po ulit, SEC, sana po ma-regularize na sila.

8338
07:36:24,630 --> 07:36:26,510
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Anim lang naman po yata sila o balo.

8339
07:36:27,170 --> 07:36:31,410
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, our apologies, pero konting-konti na lang po na pag-aantay.

8340
07:36:31,610 --> 07:36:35,610
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I spoke to Secretary Kim around 400...

