DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: These are regular positions.

8343
07:36:41,630 --> 07:36:46,210
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And we'll see to it that those deserving employees na napakatagal na

8344
07:36:46,210 --> 07:36:48,650
