8345
07:36:49,050 --> 07:36:51,630
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang nauna ko kasing lumabas yung 5,000 para sa 4P's.

8346
07:36:52,610 --> 07:36:55,590
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then nasundan ng 16 or 20?

8347
07:36:56,610 --> 07:36:57,130
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 90.

8348
07:36:57,410 --> 07:37:02,390
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 90 sa disaster and then sa social tech around 80 plus.

8349
07:37:02,830 --> 07:37:03,910
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So ito na ho yung next.

8350
07:37:04,130 --> 07:37:05,590
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I was just with him last Friday.

8351
07:37:05,590 --> 07:37:09,030
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And sabi niya, padating na, kumbaga, nandiyan na ho, antay na lang namin.

8352
07:37:09,170 --> 07:37:13,450
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And we will see to it that the employees who deserve will get those plantile positions.

8353
07:37:13,810 --> 07:37:16,050
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Secrex, maungulit ako up until plenary.

8354
07:37:16,410 --> 07:37:18,890
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Because it's already been a year since this was raised.

8355
07:37:19,230 --> 07:37:26,410
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I think we saw that even more when we, during our response to the Middle East crisis.

8356
07:37:27,010 --> 07:37:33,490
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Even the fuel and the transport allowance, sila na po talaga yung...

8357
