07:46:57,700 --> 07:47:02,620
NCDA Executive Director Glenda D. Relova: regarding provision of FSL training to all LGUs.

8543
07:47:04,120 --> 07:47:05,120
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you.

8544
07:47:05,300 --> 07:47:08,920
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And last question, how has the council complied with,

8545
07:47:09,260 --> 07:47:15,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: as evidenced in PS appropriations previously and prospectively for 2027,

8546
07:47:15,520 --> 07:47:21,520
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: for the mandate of RA 10524 on quotas for hiring of persons with disabilities,

8547
07:47:22,300 --> 07:47:24,200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: specifically deaf persons?

8548
07:47:24,460 --> 07:47:27,200
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: What kinds of positions are these deaf hires?

8549
07:47:27,700 --> 07:47:35,200
NCDA Executive Director Glenda D. Relova: Currently, our positions in our local government units,

8550
07:47:35,260 --> 07:47:43,940
NCDA Executive Director Glenda D. Relova: we have 97.4% engagement or persons with disability compliance.

8551
07:47:43,940 --> 07:47:49,920
NCDA Executive Director Glenda D. Relova: But only 400 are those who have regular positions.

8552
07:47:50,060 --> 07:47:52,940
NCDA Executive Director Glenda D. Relova: The rest are focal persons.

8553
07:47:54,020 --> 07:47:56,840
NCDA Executive Director Glenda D. Relova: And the NCDA will provide,

8554
07:47:56,840 --> 07:48:00,360
NCDA Executive Director Glenda D. Relova: the committee of statistics,

8555
07:48:00,660 --> 07:48:05,420
NCDA Executive Director Glenda D. Relova: who and how many persons are deaf under the PDAU.

8556
07:48:13,680 --> 07:48:15,020
Committee member: Yes, yung submission.

8557
07:48:15,760 --> 07:48:18,680
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much.

8558
07:48:18,680 --> 07:48:22,300
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So those are the questions from FSL National Network

8559
07:48:22,300 --> 07:48:24,740
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: pertaining to the National Council for Disability Affairs.

8560
07:48:25,120 --> 07:48:28,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So I hope that clarifies the questions for our CSO partners.

8561
07:48:28,700 --> 07:48:32,020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Again, we would like to reiterate our commitment

8562
07:48:32,020 --> 07:48:34,860
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: on the part of the Committee on Appropriations to continue,

8563
07:48:35,640 --> 07:48:41,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: continuously engage with the CSOs by being the bridge to the agencies.

8564
07:48:41,400 --> 07:48:41,900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Secretary?

8565
07:48:41,900 --> 07:48:46,700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Just to clarify, the initial submission we had did not contain the discussions that,

8566
07:48:46,700 --> 07:48:49,900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: the items that came about, yes, from the discussion today.

8567
07:48:50,400 --> 07:48:52,820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: No, but because of this discussion again today,

8568
07:48:53,080 --> 07:48:55,420
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: there were new items that might land.

8569
07:48:55,720 --> 07:48:57,820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yes, there's more, Madam Chair.

8570
07:48:58,060 --> 07:48:59,820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So we will send it to you.

8571
07:49:01,320 --> 07:49:02,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Three or four items.

8572
07:49:02,360 --> 07:49:03,820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We'll see to it that we submit it.

8573
07:49:04,060 --> 07:49:05,500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, if I may just be allowed,

8574
07:49:05,500 --> 07:49:09,400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I know it's post. Para akong nagre-react lastly, but we just got word.

8575
07:49:09,940 --> 07:49:14,300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I'll go back to Mila kasi it's a very important issue itong sa NCSC.

8576
07:49:14,480 --> 07:49:15,700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I just can't let it slide.

8577
07:49:15,700 --> 07:49:22,320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I just want to clarify na ang National ID, as confirmed by the PSA just now,

8578
07:49:23,100 --> 07:49:25,020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: is not the mode to identify.

8579
07:49:25,920 --> 07:49:33,000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The mode to identify is the CBMS para mahanap natin yung 80, 85, 90, 95, 100.

8580
07:49:33,760 --> 07:49:35,180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Accordingly, mali po yung notion ng executive director ng NCSC

8581
07:49:35,500 --> 07:49:43,980
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na National ID ho ang gagamitin. Hindi po ang pag-identify; CBMS

8582
07:49:43,980 --> 07:49:48,300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: at kumpleto po yung fields noon: birthday, address, so on and so forth.

8583
07:49:48,820 --> 07:49:55,180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang National ID gagamitin lamang po yan para i-validate kung yung taong yun ay sinasabi niya,

8584
07:49:55,180 --> 07:49:56,220
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ako si Rex Gatchalian.

8585
07:49:56,220 --> 07:49:57,900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ako ba talaga si Rex Gatchalian?

8586
07:49:58,340 --> 07:49:59,980
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Parang nabaliktad nila ho ata.

8587
07:50:00,300 --> 07:50:04,380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Number two, a simple data sharing agreement between them,

8588
07:50:04,380 --> 07:50:05,340
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: NCSC,

8589
07:50:06,000 --> 07:50:07,760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And PSA will be suffice.

8590
07:50:07,880 --> 07:50:10,240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: You don't need a court order to do that.

8591
07:50:10,340 --> 07:50:13,080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Among government agencies, that will only cause more delay.

8592
07:50:13,420 --> 07:50:20,000
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Habang nag-aantay na ho kayo na kailangan mabigyan po lahat ng mga 80, 85, 90, 95, 100.

8593
07:50:20,660 --> 07:50:21,240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Uulitin ko po.

8594
07:50:22,020 --> 07:50:27,820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: You can anticipate sino magba-birthday ng 80, 85 as far as three years down the road.

8595
07:50:28,320 --> 07:50:29,540
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We need to help DBM.

8596
07:50:29,760 --> 07:50:33,340
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi wala yung DBM dito na parang sila yung may kasalanan eh.

8597
07:50:33,340 --> 07:50:35,460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: You need to help DBM.

8598
07:50:35,500 --> 07:50:42,400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: You need to help DBM identify, and CBMS may not be the perfect list, but it gives you some type of confidence level.

8599
07:50:43,020 --> 07:50:44,140
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Parang actuarial yan eh.

8600
07:50:44,620 --> 07:50:47,660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Para ma-identify na natin ahead of time.

8601
07:50:47,820 --> 07:50:50,640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Plus, on demand from the local OSCA offices,

8602
07:50:51,220 --> 07:50:55,880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: that you can cross-check between their birth and their death certificates or registries.

8603
07:50:56,460 --> 07:51:00,880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi naman ho kailangan komplikado, Mr. Chair, Madam Chair.

8604
07:51:00,960 --> 07:51:02,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi ho kailangan maging komplikado ho ito.

8605
07:51:02,360 --> 07:51:04,900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pinasa na namin yung sistema.

8606
07:51:05,500 --> 07:51:09,220
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And I would highly encourage NCSC to look into that.

8607
07:51:09,320 --> 07:51:12,280
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi like you said, ang nagsu-suffer ho yung mga matatanda,

8608
07:51:12,480 --> 07:51:15,700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and at the same time hihingi na naman tayo ulit ng pera sa DBM.

8609
07:51:16,000 --> 07:51:18,500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We're in the regime of a very tight fiscal space.

8610
07:51:18,600 --> 07:51:20,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And we're trying to streamline and optimize.

8611
07:51:21,220 --> 07:51:25,320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nandoon ho kasi ako sa diskusyon tungkol ho dito since Secretary Mina till now.

8612
07:51:25,640 --> 07:51:31,500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kaya hindi ko puwedeng palagpasin yung sinasabi nila na kailangan ng court order, kailangan ng National ID.

8613
07:51:31,500 --> 07:51:35,020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I think they really have to talk to PSA kasi yung PSA nagre-react

8614
07:51:35,500 --> 07:51:36,720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: at dinadala ngayon yung sagot sa amin

8615
07:51:37,100 --> 07:51:38,120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na tama yung notion ho namin.

8616
07:51:38,960 --> 07:51:42,400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I just don't want to let the commission, the committee, end its hearing.

8617
07:51:42,580 --> 07:51:43,820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: At yun ang nakalagay sa minutes.

8618
07:51:44,160 --> 07:51:48,520
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I dispute every single fact raised by the Executive Director of NCSC.

8619
07:51:48,940 --> 07:51:55,300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And if DSWD had its way in doing this, there's a more organized, systematic way of doing it.

8620
07:51:55,480 --> 07:51:56,580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: It may not be perfect.

8621
07:51:56,700 --> 07:51:57,780
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Wala namang ahensyang perfect.

8622
07:51:57,960 --> 07:52:01,080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But it gives you a higher confidence level than by application.

8623
07:52:01,620 --> 07:52:04,100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Parang kung sino ang may access sa computer, sila mag-a-apply.

8624
07:52:04,280 --> 07:52:05,380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Tapos yun lang ang susuriin natin.

8625
07:52:05,500 --> 07:52:08,640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: That's what we're trying to do.

8626
07:52:08,840 --> 07:52:09,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Secrex.

8627
07:52:10,040 --> 07:52:15,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I think we really need to develop that system that you already have a form.

8628
07:52:15,440 --> 07:52:19,140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I think this is a similar issue to the free higher education.

8629
07:52:19,340 --> 07:52:26,340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: It's a bit of a far analogy, but it's really an issue in terms of yung forecasting.

8630
07:52:26,540 --> 07:52:30,140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: They're unable to get it right in terms of the system.

8631
07:52:30,340 --> 07:52:37,000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Hindi po makapag-align at the moment yung CHED, yung PASUC at saka yung DBM

8632
07:52:37,640 --> 07:52:41,640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: With regard to the estimated number of enrollees for the following year.

8633
07:52:41,840 --> 07:52:45,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So every year, nagbaliktad naman yung problema nila, Secrex.

8634
07:52:45,640 --> 07:52:52,140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sa distribution po doon sa octogenarian award, ang nangyayari po delay.

8635
07:52:52,340 --> 07:53:06,840
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Doon naman po sa FHE, free higher education, ang nangyayari nag-a-accrue lang, nag-a-accumulate lang yung deficiency between the gap nung estimated number of enrollees

8636
07:53:07,640 --> 07:53:09,340
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: versus the actual number of enrollees.

8637
07:53:09,540 --> 07:53:18,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Umabot pa nga po sa point na across five years, Php12 billion yung na-accrue na deficit.

8638
07:53:18,240 --> 07:53:24,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So it's really, I think there has to be a system po. I agree with Sec Rex.

8639
07:53:24,640 --> 07:53:28,140
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And I think before the next budget season, sana maayos na.

8640
07:53:28,340 --> 07:53:34,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kasi yung sa FHE po naayos nila between last year and this year's budget season.

8641
07:53:34,440 --> 07:53:35,640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Pero yun po kasi nangyayari.

8642
07:53:35,840 --> 07:53:37,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: I recognize the problem.

8643
07:53:37,640 --> 07:53:41,640
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Na ang nangyayari, nade-delay yung distribution po.

8644
07:53:41,840 --> 07:53:48,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, as Secrex was saying, kaya naman because the PSA has a database.

8645
07:53:48,640 --> 07:53:54,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: In fact, we gave them this system of forecasting in advance with a higher confidence level.

8646
07:53:54,640 --> 07:53:58,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Syempre give or take. Meron hong kasamang palad, papanaw.

8647
07:53:58,640 --> 07:54:01,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero wala naman ho madadagdag na doon, more or less,

8648
07:54:01,640 --> 07:54:05,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kasi alam mo na naman sino mag-80, 85, 90, 95, 100.

8649
07:54:05,640 --> 07:54:07,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, Mr. Chairman.

8650
07:54:07,640 --> 07:54:08,840
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I have to keep on repeating this.

8651
07:54:09,040 --> 07:54:10,240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mag-a-accrue ito nang mag-a-accrue.

8652
07:54:10,440 --> 07:54:14,240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: As mentioned by the executive director kanina, may backlog na.

8653
07:54:14,440 --> 07:54:15,640
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Tapos magba-backlog ulit.

8654
07:54:15,840 --> 07:54:17,040
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Tapos magba-backlog ulit.

8655
07:54:17,240 --> 07:54:21,240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Baka ho mag-accrue nang mag-accrue yung mga IOUs till pumanaw na yung iba at hindi matanggap.

8656
07:54:21,440 --> 07:54:25,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: I may sound like we're pointing fingers, but ang point ko ho is help.

8657
07:54:25,640 --> 07:54:29,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We already gave them the system, the process.

8658
07:54:29,640 --> 07:54:31,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And I think DBM will agree with that.

8659
07:54:31,640 --> 07:54:35,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Sana lang ho tingnan nila kasi the answers of the executive director kanina

8660
07:54:35,640 --> 07:54:36,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: was really way off.

8661
07:54:36,440 --> 07:54:41,240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kaya yung PSA sumagot na sa amin at pinapasagutin daw namin nang maayos.

8662
07:54:44,240 --> 07:54:50,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: May I then call the ED of NCSC?

8663
07:54:50,440 --> 07:54:53,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Na-release na po ni Sec Rex.

8664
07:54:53,440 --> 07:54:55,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And I think that's a very valid point.

8665
07:54:55,440 --> 07:54:57,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's a way for us to be able to forecast it.

8666
07:54:57,440 --> 07:55:03,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: There's the PSA who seems to be willing to help to develop the system.

8667
07:55:03,440 --> 07:55:06,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Have you engaged with the PSA?

8668
07:55:06,440 --> 07:55:10,440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: And have you looked at the forecasting model as suggested by Secrex?

8669
07:55:10,640 --> 07:55:16,240
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Yes, we have met with PSA and that's what they said.

8670
07:55:16,440 --> 07:55:19,240
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: And that's what I said a few minutes ago.

8671
07:55:19,440 --> 07:55:25,240
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: So we can talk and discuss about this, what they're saying about the forecasting.

8672
07:55:25,440 --> 07:55:30,240
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Because I think if we are able to get the data from the PhilSys PSA,

8673
07:55:30,440 --> 07:55:32,240
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: we can also do the forecasting.

8674
07:55:32,440 --> 07:55:36,040
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So ngayon po, can we assume that in the future,

8675
07:55:36,440 --> 07:55:42,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: in the 2027 budget, hindi pa accurate yung number na nabudgetan ninyo?

8676
07:55:42,440 --> 07:55:47,240
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Given that you still haven't done the study on this forecasting model?

8677
07:55:47,440 --> 07:55:59,560
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: The numbers that we have given for the 2027 NEP came from the numbers of PSA.

8678
07:55:59,760 --> 07:56:00,560
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: PSA?

8679
07:56:00,760 --> 07:56:02,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: PSA na census po yon.

8680
07:56:02,760 --> 07:56:04,110
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So should be, Sec Rex?

8681
07:56:04,110 --> 07:56:04,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ayoko na ho.

8682
07:56:04,760 --> 07:56:07,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ayoko na ho makipag-back and forth kasi mahaba na ho.

8683
07:56:07,760 --> 07:56:09,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: A couple of things.

8684
07:56:09,760 --> 07:56:11,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The PhilSys is coded.

8685
07:56:11,760 --> 07:56:14,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So hindi mo talaga makukuha yung PhilSys ng lahat ng mamamayan.

8686
07:56:14,760 --> 07:56:16,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi talaga ibibigay sa iyo yun.

8687
07:56:16,760 --> 07:56:22,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero yung CBMS, that law has a very clear escape mechanism.

8688
07:56:22,760 --> 07:56:26,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pag social protection, lahat kami dapat doon humahango.

8689
07:56:26,760 --> 07:56:30,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Puwedeng ibigay yun with a simple data sharing agreement.

8690
07:56:30,760 --> 07:56:33,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Iniwan na ho namin yan bago namin tinurnover.

8691
07:56:33,760 --> 07:56:35,560
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nakiusap kami na yun ang gamitin.

8692
07:56:35,560 --> 07:56:40,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero parang hihingin mo yung buong PhilSys database.

8693
07:56:40,560 --> 07:56:46,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Hindi ho talaga ibibigay yun because nandoon yung mga codes natin lahat as individual citizens.

8694
07:56:46,560 --> 07:56:51,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Again, we can have a discussion separately, pagpatawag ho kami ng Kongreso,

8695
07:56:51,560 --> 07:56:54,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: but the budgeting kasi is getting affected by this.

8696
07:56:54,560 --> 07:56:58,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Parang it's turning into a habol nang habol every year

8697
07:56:58,560 --> 07:57:00,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kasi post eh.

8698
07:57:00,560 --> 07:57:02,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Mag-a-apply sila online,

8699
07:57:02,360 --> 07:57:06,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: katulad doon ng kaso natin sa Pampanga na kami ho ang hinabol ng mga tao.

8700
07:57:06,360 --> 07:57:09,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nasa bundok sila, mga Aeta ho sila,

8701
07:57:09,360 --> 07:57:11,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: natural hindi sila makakapag-apply.

8702
07:57:11,360 --> 07:57:13,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: At walang technical know-how yung mga yun.

8703
07:57:13,360 --> 07:57:16,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero if we just project na nandun sila,

8704
07:57:16,360 --> 07:57:21,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: because sa CBMS, again, it's not perfect, but it gives you a stronger confidence level.

8705
07:57:21,360 --> 07:57:24,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Then we can just go to them, validate it physically.

8706
07:57:24,360 --> 07:57:30,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Para ho meron tayong some type of a closer estimate kung ilan ho sila.

8707
07:57:30,360 --> 07:57:32,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you, Secrex.

8708
07:57:32,360 --> 07:57:38,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Kong Mila, being the chairperson of the Committee on Senior Citizens,

8709
07:57:38,360 --> 07:57:41,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: maybe this is something that you can also facilitate.

8710
07:57:41,360 --> 07:57:49,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: A discussion with all the agencies involved to fine-tune this forecasting system.

8711
07:57:49,360 --> 07:57:56,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Just so in the next budget cycle, or even baka po makahabol pa before the end of this budget cycle, maayos na natin

8712
07:57:56,360 --> 07:58:00,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: para po hindi, as Secrex was saying and as I was saying,

8713
07:58:00,360 --> 07:58:02,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: mag-accrue lahat po ng

8714
07:58:02,360 --> 07:58:04,160
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: hindi pa nire-release,

8715
07:58:04,360 --> 07:58:06,160
